    "Clinician Notes (optional)": "临床人员备注（选填）",
    "These soft pastilles feed your gut probiotics to grow and stay strong. These good microbes help you better digest food and absorb essential nutrients, keep your immune system active, and even improve your mood.": "这些软锭滋养肠道益生菌，帮助它们生长并保持活力。益生菌有助于消化食物、吸收重要营养、维持免疫系统活跃，甚至改善心情。",
    "These clinically formulated soft pastilles helps your body better absorb natural vitamin C, amino acids, polypeptides and dietary calcium for muscle recovery and stronger bones. These soft pastilles have also been studied to reduce inflammation thus supporting joint and ligament flexibility.": "这些经临床配制的软锭有助身体更好地吸收天然维生素C、氨基酸、多肽和膳食钙，促进肌肉恢复并强健骨骼。研究也显示其有助减轻炎症，从而支持关节与韧带的灵活性。",
    "Organic ALA Omega 3, MCT 8, MCT10 and B-Complex in these soft pastilles are absorbed quickly in the mouth giving you more natural energy to recover from fatigue, improve attention span and reduce brain fog. These soft pastilles contain polyphenols with natural anti-inflammatory benefits, helping your body rebound after daily walks or workouts.": "软锭中的有机 ALA Omega 3、MCT 8、MCT10 和维生素B群可在口腔中快速吸收，提供天然能量，帮助缓解疲劳、提升专注力并减轻脑雾。其中的多酚具有天然抗炎益处，帮助身体在日常步行或运动后恢复。",
    "These nutrient rich soft pastilles helps your good bacteria in your gut to grow and stay strong. Your own probiotics help you better digest food and absorb important nutrients, can stop sugar cravings and even improve your mood.": "这些营养丰富的软锭帮助肠道益菌生长并保持活力。自身的益生菌能帮助消化食物、吸收重要营养、减少嗜甜，甚至改善心情。",
    "These soft pastilles are well formulated to help your body better absorb natural vitamin C, amino acids, dietary calcium and magnesium for muscle recovery and stronger bones. I also have improved joint flexibility and have less pain.": "这些软锭配方完善，有助身体更好地吸收天然维生素C、氨基酸、膳食钙和镁，促进肌肉恢复并强健骨骼。我的关节灵活性也有所提升，疼痛减少了。",
    "I feel the Omega 3, MCTs and B vitamins are easily and quickly absorbed in my mouth. I quickly get natural energy to rebound after workouts, recover from daily tiredness and also very much less brain fog.": "我感觉 Omega 3、MCT 和维生素B很容易在口腔中快速吸收。我很快获得天然能量，运动后恢复得更好，日常疲劳和脑雾也大幅减少。",
    "I'm currently consuming my first box, and I'm impressed with how my body is responding. The first change I noticed was my energy level — I feel more alert, lighter, and able to work out without feeling drained.👍 Another big improvement is my skin. I've always had dry areas around my mouth, but lately my skin feels more hydrated and comfortable. It's a nice surprise. I didn't expect so soon. The soft pastilles themselves are easy to bring anywhere, easy to consume, and taste really good": "我正在服用第一盒，身体的反应令我很惊喜。最先注意到的是能量水平——我更精神、身体更轻盈，运动时也不再觉得精疲力竭。👍 皮肤也有明显改善。嘴周一直容易干燥，最近却更水润舒适，效果来得比预期更快。软锭方便携带、容易服用，味道也很好。",
    "How do these soft-pastilles help my sensitive / ageing skin?": "这些软锭如何帮助敏感或老化肌肤？",
    "Can these soft-pastilles help with ageing discomforts and keep up with daily demands?": "这些软锭能帮助缓解老化不适并应对日常需求吗？",
    "A tasty fruit-based soft pastille made with an organic blend of plant nutrients and halal gelatine that supports collagen synthesis. Soft pastilles are a source of plant-based Ascorbate (Vitamin C) antioxidants and anti-inflammatory compounds to help your body and mind stay active.": "这是一款美味的水果基底软锭，由有机植物营养素和清真明胶混合制成，可支持胶原蛋白合成。软锭提供植物来源的抗坏血酸（维生素C）抗氧化物和抗炎成分，帮助身心保持活力。",
    "These nutrient-rich soft-pastilles contain natural amino acids, glycoproteins, polyphenols, and ascorbate (dietary vitamin-c) to reduce skin sensitivity, strengthen joints and nails, and support muscle recovery. These soft-pastilles promote natural collagen and elastin production, helping your skin feel firmer with a healthier glow.": "这些营养丰富的软锭含天然氨基酸、糖蛋白、多酚和抗坏血酸（膳食维生素C），有助降低皮肤敏感、强健关节和指甲并支持肌肉恢复。它还促进天然胶原蛋白与弹性蛋白生成，使肌肤更紧致、焕发健康光泽。",
    "It’s a unique blend of ancient soluble plant fibres and resistant starches that feed your gut’s good bacteria, improving digestion, nutrient absorption, and easing bowel movement.": "这是由传统可溶性植物纤维和抗性淀粉组成的独特配方，可滋养肠道益菌，改善消化和营养吸收，并帮助排便顺畅。",
    "MCT C8 & C10 (from virgin coconut oil) combined with ALA=Omega 3 are energy lipids that quickly refuel your body and brain, keeping you active and refreshed.": "源自初榨椰子油的 MCT C8 与 C10，配合 ALA=Omega 3，是能快速为身体和大脑补充能量的脂质，让您保持活力与清醒。",
    "Place a soft-pastille twice or thrice daily under your tongue for faster absorption, or as advised by your doctor, counsellor, pharmacist, or nutritionist.": "每天两至三次将一颗软锭置于舌下，以加快吸收；或遵照医生、顾问、药剂师或营养师的建议。",
    "Yes! They are made without any artificial colours, sweeteners, preservatives, or hidden additives. These soft pastilles use Low GI Nipa Fructans from Sarawak’s Gula Apong.": "是的！产品不含人工色素、甜味剂、防腐剂或隐藏添加物，并采用来自砂拉越亚答糖的低升糖指数水椰果聚糖。",
    "They have a naturally fruity taste from organic ingredients such as roselle, plantain, gooseberry, and soursop, making them enjoyable to take by children, active adults, and older adults.": "有机洛神花、车前草、余甘子和刺果番荔枝等成分带来自然果香，儿童、活跃成人和年长者都能愉快服用。",
    "Yes! The unique blend of natural Vitamin C, amino acids, glycoproteins, polyphenols, and ALA-Omega 3 works together (nutrient synergy) to support muscle recovery, strengthen skin and nails, and improve joint comfort and flexibility; helping you feel alert and ready for daily activity.": "是的！天然维生素C、氨基酸、糖蛋白、多酚与 ALA-Omega 3 的独特配方协同作用，支持肌肉恢复、强健皮肤和指甲，并改善关节舒适度与灵活性，让您精神充沛地应对日常活动。",
    "Yes! These soft pastilles are specially crafted to support women’s wellness; helping boost energy and mood, enhance skin hydration, promote hormonal balance, and nurture overall vitality for a beautiful you.": "是的！这些软锭专为女性健康而配制，有助提升能量与心情、加强肌肤保湿、促进荷尔蒙平衡并滋养整体活力。",
    "Keep the box at or below 28°C, away from sunlight and moisture to maintain freshness.": "请将包装盒存放在28°C或以下，避免阳光直射与潮湿，以保持新鲜。",
    "They are professionally formulated and produced in Malaysia by Utara Dietetics & Plant-Based Research in partnership with a HACCP and Halal certified OEM manufacturer.": "产品由 Utara Dietetics & Plant-Based Research 专业配制，并与获得 HACCP 和清真认证的 OEM 制造商合作在马来西亚生产。",
    "Yes! Independent customer reviews and patient feedback to doctors consistently rate our soft pastilles at five stars, reflecting high satisfaction in areas such as taste, effectiveness, overall wellness support, and value for money.": "是的！独立客户评价和患者向医生提供的反馈持续给予我们的软锭五星评价，显示大家对口味、效果、整体健康支持及性价比都非常满意。",
